    {
      "id": "c9a523f653e4cad5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -360,
      "width": 2000,
      "height": 170,
      "text": "# Industry and laboratories — founders, research and transitions\n\nCompany, laboratory and university are separate classes. Employment, investment and acquisition are never represented as the same relation.\n\n[[00 Start Here|Guide]] · [[01 Map Index|All maps]] · [[03 Evidence and Open Questions|Evidence rules]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "5a8fadb45316106c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2100,
      "y": -360,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 170,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** blue · **◆ INSTITUTION** purple · **■ COMPANY** amber · **▣ LAB / TEAM** green · **◇ CONTEXT** grey\n\n**V** green edges = primary-source checked. **B** amber edges = book report. Full evidence and dates are in the linked notes. Grouping is navigation, not a current org chart."
    },
    {
      "id": "12ecc15f76ff9f9f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**■ COMPANY** · book + web\n\n### [[Companies/Google|Google]]\n\nTechnology company; acquired DeepMind in 2014.\n\n[Profile / source](https://about.google/)",
      "color": "#E8AD59"
    },
    {
      "id": "7c7eae9bca3b6357",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 410,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**■ COMPANY** · book\n\n### [[Companies/Alphabet|Alphabet]]\n\nGoogle parent mentioned in foreword\n\n[[Sources/Hassabis - source book.pdf#page=30|PDF p. 30]] · profile pending",
      "color": "#E8AD59"
    },
    {
      "id": "3e4e88c3829de113",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**▣ LAB** · book + web\n\n### [[Labs/Google Brain|Google Brain]]\n\nFormer Google Research team combined into Google DeepMind in 2023.\n\n[Profile / source](https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/ai/april-ai-update/)",
      "color": "#63BFA7"
    },
    {
      "id": "a7ccff80418d5dba",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 410,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**▣ LAB** · book + web\n\n### [[Labs/Google DeepMind|Google DeepMind]]\n\nGoogle unit created in 2023 by combining DeepMind and Google Brain.\n\n[Profile / source](https://deepmind.google/about/)",
      "color": "#63BFA7"
    },
    {
      "id": "4db7d83bc80ceb23",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 660,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**■ COMPANY** · book + web\n\n### [[Companies/DeepMind|DeepMind]]\n\nCompany founded 2010; acquired by Google 2014; historical entity distinguished from 2023 Google DeepMind.\n\n[Profile / source](https://deepmind.google/blog/from-unlikely-start-up-to-major-scientific-organisation-entering-our-tenth-year-at-deepmind/)",
      "color": "#E8AD59"
    },
    {
      "id": "998a396e3daeca84",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 410,
      "y": 660,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** · book + web\n\n### [[People/Demis Hassabis|Demis Hassabis]]\n\nDeepMind co-founder; cognitive-neuroscience PhD.\n\n[Profile / source](https://www.ae-info.org/ae/Member/Hassabis_Demis/CV)",
      "color": "#43A8D1"
    },
    {
      "id": "a94b2c118b082fc9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 990,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** · book\n\n### [[People/Jeff Dean|Jeff Dean]]\n\nGoogle Brain leader at Wuzhen event\n\n[[Sources/Hassabis - source book.pdf#page=38|PDF p. 38]] · profile pending",
      "color": "#43A8D1"
    },
    {
      "id": "a9f5c343ff4a726e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 410,
      "y": 990,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** · book\n\n### [[People/Larry Page|Larry Page]]\n\nGoogle co-founder and DeepMind acquisition sponsor.\n\n[[Sources/Hassabis - source book.pdf#page=58|PDF p. 58]] · profile pending",
      "color": "#43A8D1"
    },
    {
      "id": "c4bec606b0b30fd6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1320,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** · book\n\n### [[People/Sergey Brin|Sergey Brin]]\n\nGoogle co-founder; prospective wealthy backer discussed by Suleyman and Hassabis\n\n[[Sources/Hassabis - source book.pdf#page=143|PDF p. 143]] · profile pending",
      "color": "#43A8D1"
    },
    {
      "id": "a6ddba0aa4463871",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 410,
      "y": 1320,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** · book\n\n### [[People/Sundar Pichai|Sundar Pichai]]\n\nGoogle executive; book mentions Wharton MBA.\n\n[[Sources/Hassabis - source book.pdf#page=302|PDF p. 302]] · profile pending",
      "color": "#43A8D1"
    },
    {
      "id": "de7286bb651be1c3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1300,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**■ COMPANY** · book + web\n\n### [[Companies/OpenAI|OpenAI]]\n\nAI research organization founded in 2015; this link documents its founding structure.\n\n[Profile / source](https://openai.com/index/introducing-openai/)",
      "color": "#E8AD59"
    },
    {
      "id": "a6b07f2fd9c65bb7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1710,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** · book + web\n\n### [[People/Sam Altman|Sam Altman]]\n\nNamed in OpenAI’s founding announcement; link is a historical institutional source.\n\n[Profile / source](https://openai.com/index/introducing-openai/)",
      "color": "#43A8D1"
    },
    {
      "id": "afb740524001e524",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1300,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** · book + web\n\n### [[People/Elon Musk|Elon Musk]]\n\nNamed in OpenAI’s founding announcement; link is a historical institutional source.\n\n[Profile / source](https://openai.com/index/introducing-openai/)",
      "color": "#43A8D1"
    },
    {
      "id": "0c29ee64315d8f1f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1710,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** · book + web\n\n### [[People/Greg Brockman|Greg Brockman]]\n\nNamed in OpenAI’s founding announcement; link is a historical institutional source.\n\n[Profile / source](https://openai.com/index/introducing-openai/)",
      "color": "#43A8D1"
    },
    {
      "id": "1af7054eebedd088",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1300,
      "y": 660,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** · book + web\n\n### [[People/Ilya Sutskever|Ilya Sutskever]]\n\nHinton PhD alumnus, DNNresearch and OpenAI cofounder; historical university profile.\n\n[Profile / source](https://www.cs.toronto.edu/~ilya/)",
      "color": "#43A8D1"
    },
    {
      "id": "37a218d0008e7b02",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1710,
      "y": 660,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** · book + web\n\n### [[People/Dario Amodei|Dario Amodei]]\n\nAnthropic cofounder.\n\n[Profile / source](https://www.anthropic.com/company/leadership)",
      "color": "#43A8D1"
    },
    {
      "id": "c1e3b1299e905050",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1300,
      "y": 990,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**■ COMPANY** · book + web\n\n### [[Companies/Anthropic|Anthropic]]\n\nAI company founded by Amodei.\n\n[Profile / source](https://www.anthropic.com/company)",
      "color": "#E8AD59"
    },
    {
      "id": "43d3edfe7df40d77",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1710,
      "y": 990,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**■ COMPANY** · web extension\n\n### [[Companies/Safe Superintelligence|Safe Superintelligence]]\n\nAI research company; official updates establish Sutskever's CEO role.\n\n[Profile / source](https://ssi.inc/updates)",
      "color": "#E8AD59"
    },
    {
      "id": "08f58cf88008975e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1300,
      "y": 1320,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** · book + web\n\n### [[People/John Schulman|John Schulman]]\n\nNamed in OpenAI’s founding announcement; link is a historical institutional source.\n\n[Profile / source](https://openai.com/index/introducing-openai/)",
