      "x": 1710,
      "y": 1320,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** · book + web\n\n### [[People/Noam Brown|Noam Brown]]\n\nOpenAI research scientist; previously FAIR (Meta); CMU PhD.\n\n[Profile / source](https://noambrown.com/)",
      "color": "#43A8D1"
