      "y": 0,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**■ COMPANY** · book\n\n### [[Companies/Meta|Meta]]\n\nAI research company; renamed Meta.\n\n[[Sources/Hassabis - source book.pdf#page=360|PDF p. 360]] · profile pending",
      "color": "#E8AD59"
    },
