      "x": 3010,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**▣ LAB** · book + web\n\n### [[Labs/FAIR|FAIR]]\n\nIndustrial AI research unit; founding director LeCun.\n\n[Profile / source](https://cims.nyu.edu/ai/events/919/)",
      "color": "#63BFA7"
